OL,3,ANvidia strikes $12.9bn deal to buy AI
OL,4,Aplatform Hugging Face
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal would bring one of the world's
OL,7,Flargest AI developer communities into
OL,8,FNvidia and give it control of a leading
OL,9,Fopen-source platform - an alternative
OL,10,Fto systems offered by OpenAI and
OL,11,FAnthropic.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
