OL,3,AWhy Northern Ireland was the 'perfect
OL,4,Aplace' for Robin Hood's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Belfast actress, who played a small
OL,7,Frole in the film, told BBC News NI
OL,8,Fabout sharing the screen with A-listers
OL,9,Fand why Northern Ireland was now "the
OL,10,Fperfect place" to make a film.
OL,12,FTabitha Smyth, from the east of the
OL,13,Fcity, was cast as Sarah in her first
OL,14,Frole in a major studio feature film.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
